<title>UK: Sumitomo Construction sets $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Construction sets $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Sumitomo Finance International and Sumitomo Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO CONSTRUCTION CO LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE SUMITOMO BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 6M LIBOR  MATURITY    30.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +17 BP    PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
